    "answer": "to{} destroy/demolish/pull-down/tear-down/level | disturb/put-into-disorder/throw-off-balance/make-shaky | relax-(one's-pose)/make-oneself-at-ease | break-(a-bill)/change/make-change | write-in-cursive-style/write-in-running-style | break-into-a-smile/let-off-a-smile | lower-(a-price)",
